    "Dark suits city neon at night. Light brings natural daylight tones; the map switches with the theme. Choose System to follow your iOS appearance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark passt zu nächtlichem Stadt-Neon, Light bringt natürliche Tageslichttöne, und die Karte folgt dem Thema. Wähle System, um dem iOS-Erscheinungsbild zu folgen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark se adapta al neón nocturno; Light aporta tonos de luz natural y el mapa cambia con el tema. Elige System para seguir la apariencia de iOS."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le mode Dark va avec les néons urbains la nuit ; Light apporte des tons de lumière naturelle et la carte suit le thème. Choisissez System pour suivre l'apparence d'iOS."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark si adatta al neon notturno della città; Light porta tonalità di luce naturale e la mappa segue il tema. Scegli System per seguire l'aspetto di iOS."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark は夜のシティネオンに、Light は昼の自然光に合います。マップもテーマに連動します。System を選ぶと iOS の外観設定に追従します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark는 야간 네온 분위기에, Light는 자연광 톤에 어울리며 지도도 테마에 따라 바뀌어요. System을 선택하면 iOS 외관 설정을 따릅니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark combina com o neon noturno da cidade; Light traz tons de luz natural e o mapa muda junto com o tema. Escolha System para acompanhar a aparência do iOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark 适合夜晚的霓虹氛围；Light 呈现自然日光色调，地图也会随主题切换。选择 System 即跟随 iOS 外观设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark 適合夜晚的霓虹氛圍；Light 呈現自然日光色調，地圖會隨主題切換。選擇 System 將跟隨 iOS 外觀設定。"
          }
        }
      }
